<title>PORTUGAL: Caixa Geral de Depositos posts lower 96 net profit.</title>
<headline>Caixa Geral de Depositos posts lower 96 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Dec 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net 49.8 vs 58.4</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit 78.9 vs 79.8</p>
<p>Deposits 5,600.0 vs 5,049.7</p>
<p>Loans 3,145.4 vs 2,945.6</p>
<p>Net assets 7,327.2 vs 6,898.0</p>
<p>NOTE: State-owned Caixa Geral de Depositos (CGD) is Portugal's largest bank.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
